Add `desktopName` to packages/desktop/package.json so Electron's
ozone-wayland sets the running window's app_id to "opencode-desktop"
(matching the .desktop entry's StartupWMClass). This is the Electron API
surfaced by https://github.com/electron/electron/pull/51426; without it
chromium 41 leaves wm_class empty (issue #51375) and KDE Plasma falls back
to a generic icon for the running window.

--- a/packages/desktop/package.json
+++ b/packages/desktop/package.json
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
 {
   "name": "@opencode-ai/desktop",
+  "desktopName": "opencode-desktop",
   "private": true,
